<view><view class="card-box"><view class="title-wrapper"><text class="title-one">职位描述</text><text class="title-two">请对当前职位进行详尽的描述</text></view><view class="company-wrapper"><textarea class="textarea" maxlength="2000" placeholder="{{jobDescriptionPlaceholder}}" placeholder-class="placeholder" data-event-opts="{{[['input',[['__set_model',['','jobDescription','$event',[]]]]]]}}" value="{{jobDescription}}" bindinput="__e"></textarea></view><view class="tips-box"><view class="tips"><text class="tip-zero">注意事项</text><text class="tip-item">1. 请勿填写QQ、微信、电话等联系方式</text><text class="tip-item">2. 请勿填写带有性别歧视、地域歧视等内容</text><text class="tip-item">3. 务必用词恰当，请勿违反劳动法相关内容</text></view></view></view></view>